# Project parameter overrides, loaded after copter.parm + gazebo-iris.parm in
# SITL and to be applied on the real flight controller as well.
#
# Never change yaw on our own. The default (2, "face next waypoint") makes
# GUIDED velocity commands with yaw ignored turn the nose toward the direction
# of travel. That rotates the level frame mid-manoeuvre, so body-frame
# velocity commands spiral and the observation frame drifts. Found in Step 8
# sysid: a -3 m/s x command produced ~2 m/s in y.
WP_YAW_BEHAVIOR 0
